# Frontend environment variables (Vite exposes only VITE_-prefixed vars).
# Copy this file to .env if you need to override anything. It is OPTIONAL:
# the client already defaults to "/api", which works both locally (Vite dev
# proxy, see vite.config.ts) and in production (Vercel rewrite, see vercel.json).

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api